   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "WANDERING\n\n[my thing, across, away,\n a die of 3, a -2, a x1/25]\n\nEach round, on each step:\n  the die lands on it: 1..3\n  the -2 lands on it: -1..1\n  the x1/25 lands on it\n  a copy goes to the bird\n\nThat is all wandering is."
